# Try the HTTP-triggered function locally (func start -> http://localhost:7071)
# 1) post an invoice through the API (Invoice.CqrsAPI.http section 6)  2) then:

@fnBase = http://localhost:7071
@invoiceId = 1

### Re-announce a Posted invoice (locally no function key is needed; in Azure add ?code=<function key>)
POST {{fnBase}}/api/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/resend
